 "_doc": "Seenfy, concept D 'Afişin Işığı' - made with store-screenshots 2.2 in direct mode from the same evidence and DNA as the pilot (set.json). It uses most of what the scene engine can do, each effect with its source in the campaign's materials: 3D phones with one camera, a rim light and a bezel sheen, a context phone, a span pair, a frosted glass pane, glow, a callout, an SVG motif, a hand mark. App Store sizes get the 3D phones; Google Play gets flat screens (Play advises against device imagery). Render: python3 skills/store-screenshots/scripts/compose.py render examples/seenfy-v2/afisin-isigi.json --out out/",
